{"id":"b07cf6e91885e3f6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence.md","title":"Substitution and Extension Frege","display":"thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence — Substitution and Extension Frege","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence","aliases":["72-thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence"],"display":"thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence — Substitution and Extension Frege","depends_on":["[[72-df-frege-system]]","[[72-df-substitution-frege]]","[[72-df-extended-frege]]","[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 8.1.10; printed pp. 593-594; PDF pp. 605-606","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"Both conversion constructions reviewed; fixed Frege derivation blocks and detailed polynomial bounds not fully reconstructed","round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-extension-frege-equivalence — Substitution and Extension Frege"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dadbe463a5c99c0a\" href=\"?note=dadbe463a5c99c0a\" title=\"72-df-substitution-frege\">72-df-substitution-frege</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c53ee8b5af941c0e\" href=\"?note=c53ee8b5af941c0e\" title=\"72-df-extended-frege\">72-df-extended-frege</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 8.1.10; printed pp. 593-594; PDF pp. 605-606"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Both conversion constructions reviewed; fixed Frege derivation blocks and detailed polynomial bounds not fully reconstructed"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SFProof}\">\\(\\operatorname{SFProof}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EFProof}\">\\(\\operatorname{EFProof}\\)</span> 分别如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dadbe463a5c99c0a\" href=\"?note=dadbe463a5c99c0a\" title=\"72-df-substitution-frege\">72-df-substitution-frege</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c53ee8b5af941c0e\" href=\"?note=c53ee8b5af941c0e\" title=\"72-df-extended-frege\">72-df-extended-frege</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 直接使用该上游的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 上的既定编码及双向多项式大小界，不另选择编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}(w):=\\begin{cases}\n\\iota\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)=w),&amp;w\\in\\operatorname{enc}[\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}],\\\\\n\\langle\\rangle,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{enc}[\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}].\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dec}(w):=\\begin{cases}\n\\iota\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)=w),&amp;w\\in\\operatorname{enc}[\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}],\\\\\n\\langle\\rangle,&amp;w\\notin\\operatorname{enc}[\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}].\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists f,g\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\operatorname{dec}(f(\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi))),\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\operatorname{dec}(g(\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi))),\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists f,g\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\operatorname{dec}(f(\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi))),\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\operatorname{dec}(g(\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi))),\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 8.1.10，印刷页 593–594，PDF 页 605–606。原书对任意 substitution Frege 与任意 extension Frege 系统陈述多项式等价；这里固定同一个基底 Frege 系统，保留两个方向的有效转换。</li>\n<li>已核对定理陈述并阅读两个方向的构造：EF 到 SF 先把扩展定义移入蕴涵前件，再依次代入定义；SF 到 EF 用各阶段新的变量副本保存先前代入的结构，并为代入行引入扩展定义。</li>\n<li>本次没有逐项重建所有固定 Frege 推导片段或其多项式界，故只记录来源陈述对应及已读证明范围，不标作机器验证或独立完整证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-frege-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-frege","status":"resolved","id":"dadbe463a5c99c0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-frege]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-extended-frege","status":"resolved","id":"c53ee8b5af941c0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-extended-frege]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d"